// Mockingbird (Peter, Paul & Mary)

Tempo 80
Keysig G

Groove Metronome2-4
Volume p
   z * 2

Set GCount 1

Groove LullabyIntro
Chord-Sus Volume pppp

Begin Solo
    Voice JazzGuitar
    Volume p
    Articulate 110
    Harmony OpenBelow
    Octave 5
    Rtime 5
    Rvolume 10
    Begin Riff
       4b;d+;g+;d+;
       4a;d+;f+;d+;
       4g;b;d+;b;
       4a;f;2d;
    End
End

Swell pp mp 4
1          G
2          D
3          G
4         D7

Groove Lullaby1
Cresc pp m 4

5          G
6         D7
7          /
8         G
Repeat

Groove $GCount LullabyPlus Lullaby1Plus LullabyWalk
Volume mp

9          G
10        D7
11         /
12         G

Groove Lullaby
Volume m

13         /

RepeatEnding 2
Swell m mf 2

14        D7
15         /
16        G

Inc GCount

RepeatEnd

Groove LullabySus
Chord-Sus Volume ppp
Decresc mp ppp 6
Tempo -10 6

17        D7
18         /
19         G
20         /

21         D7
22         /

Groove LullabyEnd

23        G

